    "explanation": "Illidan strives when played with any Hero that can increase his survivability, be it through Shielding effects, Armor, or raw instant healing. He is typically known to requires allied Heroes known as \"enablers\" to be at his best.\n\nMedivh is one of the best enablers for Illidan, due to how he covers Illidan's weaknesses to burst damage while he is under crowd control. Additionally, it is important to not use Force of Will during Evasion, since the overlap of 2 defensive Abilities may considerably cripple Illidan's survivability. We recommend using Medivh's shield right after Evasion runs out, so Illidan can reset his cooldowns while protected."
  },
