    {
      "name": "Split Build",
      "label": "Situational",
      "description": "The Split Build is the weakest in the early game, but after completing Unending Hatred and Unbound's quests, it becomes extremely powerful. Focused on maximum single-target damage, Illidan can easily win fights when outnumbered in the late game.\n\nSince Illidan may be split-pushing in most of the game, the recommended Heroic Ability is The Hunt. However, if you're certain the game will not end soon, consider Metamorphosis and Demonic Form instead. These will significantly boosting your damage, mobility, and resistance to crowd control.",
